{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22391","headline":"西原晚望 · 白居易","name":"西原晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花菊引闲行，行上西原路。\n原上晚无人，因高聊四顾。\n南阡有烟火，北陌连墟墓。\n村邻何萧疎，近者犹百步。\n吾庐在其下，寂莫风日暮。\n门外转枯蓬，篱根伏寒兔。\n故园汴水上，离乱不堪去。\n近岁始移家，飘然此村住。\n新屋五六间，古槐八九树。\n便是衰病身，此生终老处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}